#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:2
msgid "Proxy Settings"
msgstr "Configurações de Proxy"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:4
msgid ""
"The |morpheus| Appliance can be configured to communicate through a Proxy"
" server for Cloud API's and Agent communication back to the Appliance."
msgstr "O Appliance |morpheus| pode ser configurado para se comunicar por meio de um servidor Proxy para APIs de Nuvem e comunicação do Agente de volta ao Appliance."

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:6
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:6
msgid ""
"Additional Proxy configuration is available in the `Infrastructure > "
"Network > Proxies` section. Added Proxies can be scoped to Clouds in the "
"`Edit Cloud > Advanced Options` section of the Cloud."
msgstr "Configuração adicional de Proxy está disponível na seção `Infrastructure > Network > Proxies`. Proxies adicionados podem ter escopo definido para Nuvens na seção `Edit Cloud > Advanced Options` da Nuvem."

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:8
msgid "Add a Global Proxy server by entering the following:"
msgstr "Adicione um servidor Proxy Global inserindo o seguinte:"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:10
msgid "Proxy Host"
msgstr "Host do Proxy"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:11
msgid "Proxy Port"
msgstr "Porta do Proxy"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:12
msgid "Proxy User"
msgstr "Usuário do Proxy"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:13
msgid "Proxy Password"
msgstr "Senha do Proxy"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:14
msgid "Proxy Domain"
msgstr "Domínio do Proxy"

#: ../../administration/settings/proxy.rst:15
msgid "Proxy Workstation"
msgstr "Workstation do Proxy"

